{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Kill the Brickman, a turn-based rogue-like brick breaker inspired by retro arcade madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own bullet-blasting loadouts by combining relics, clip layouts, and bizarre bullets that explode, corrode, and multiply. Every run is a new experiment. Every build is a puzzle. Every bullet is a brick-busting tool to bring home the bank.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot your way through chapters, face off against powerful bosses, and uncover synergies that turn your humble pee shooter into a galaxy-defying hand cannon. With hundreds of relics and a variety of build options, the depth here goes way deeper than just aim and fire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MAIN MISSION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123120/extras/e7e7abf08a4dad326ecc93a888c48c33.poster.avif?t=1758614631\" width=600 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123120/extras/e7e7abf08a4dad326ecc93a888c48c33.webm?t=1758614631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123120/extras/e7e7abf08a4dad326ecc93a888c48c33.mp4?t=1758614631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Choose a chapter, choose your weapon, grab an extra mission from the intergalactic bounty board if you're feeling brave enough, and fire your way to victory. Victory isn't easily earned however, so make sure you build and stack correctly to walk away with the cash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LOADOUT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123120/extras/c80927a70f52d58bd9363338fab7fb8c.poster.avif?t=1758614631\" width=600 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123120/extras/c80927a70f52d58bd9363338fab7fb8c.webm?t=1758614631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123120/extras/c80927a70f52d58bd9363338fab7fb8c.mp4?t=1758614631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your shooter, each with a unique set of starting abilities, and pay attention to Clips in the Shop that grant even more abilities to your bullets; which yes, also have abilities. It's just ability on top of ability here. Create a build and bolster your power with Relics, which yes, also have abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LOCATIONS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123120/extras/1a7216c70ebde7709733714715087cc7.poster.avif?t=1758614631\" width=600 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123120/extras/1a7216c70ebde7709733714715087cc7.webm?t=1758614631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123120/extras/1a7216c70ebde7709733714715087cc7.mp4?t=1758614631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a chapter, select your sidearm, grab an extra mission from the intergalactic bounty board if you're feeling brave enough, and fire your way to victory. Victory isn't easily earned however, so make sure you build and stack correctly to walk away with the cash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BULLET POINTS (GET IT???)</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accept extra missions if you think you can handle the pressure, big payoffs await the brave</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember to blow your bank at the Shop, re-roll if your needs aren't met!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep a keen eye on Facilities when they appear, they may just work in your favor</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"One Shot","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3123120/e73b355fc117fbaf83224dd3c2096e99d5a12cf9.jpg"},{"name":"Killah","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3123120/0d7b14bc820955be1600be2415c81d6286093415.jpg"},{"name":"Bouncy Ball","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3123120/84ed286700c6b7a87d96d5500a1d4346806a36f3.jpg"},{"name":"Gatling","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3123120/2e6dbcc147ca603e5b39753676ecd2e69fe815e7.jpg"},{"name":"Explosion is Art","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3123120/65db5a54b31cf20aa57987eab895037c6e8a967d.jpg"},{"name":"Flu Season","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3123120/c7e33f2fbfe13ebdcb281a928d5493fc4bc54085.jpg"},{"name":"Capitalist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3123120/3fe72b66f535a0b51f350586847c19f38a1fbda4.jpg"},{"name":"Cheapskate","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3123120/3c8518a374effe98020965f1767b45a82e07b624.jpg"},{"name":"Massacre","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3123120/e8143dea981d778a5f42164ddbb82b4a8adf6a42.jpg"},{"name":"Brickman Slayer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3123120/02591a075a620fdc397e0e3620ad501eeaf74583.jpg"}],"total":34},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3123120?t=1758614631","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123120/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758614631","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123120/85c880cee947adaf1f6fff0a2f5a1abd40947e1d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758614631","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123120/85c880cee947adaf1f6fff0a2f5a1abd40947e1d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758614631","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Kill the Brickman, a turn-based rogue-like brick breaker inspired by retro arcade madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own bullet-blasting loadouts by combining relics, clip layouts, and bizarre bullets that explode, corrode, and multiply. Every run is a new experiment. Every build is a puzzle. Every bullet is a brick-busting tool to bring home the bank.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot your way through chapters, face off against powerful bosses, and uncover synergies that turn your humble pee shooter into a galaxy-defying hand cannon. With hundreds of relics and a variety of build options, the depth here goes way deeper than just aim and fire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MAIN MISSION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123120/extras/e7e7abf08a4dad326ecc93a888c48c33.poster.avif?t=1758614631\" width=600 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123120/extras/e7e7abf08a4dad326ecc93a888c48c33.webm?t=1758614631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123120/extras/e7e7abf08a4dad326ecc93a888c48c33.mp4?t=1758614631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Choose a chapter, choose your weapon, grab an extra mission from the intergalactic bounty board if you're feeling brave enough, and fire your way to victory. Victory isn't easily earned however, so make sure you build and stack correctly to walk away with the cash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LOADOUT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123120/extras/c80927a70f52d58bd9363338fab7fb8c.poster.avif?t=1758614631\" width=600 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123120/extras/c80927a70f52d58bd9363338fab7fb8c.webm?t=1758614631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123120/extras/c80927a70f52d58bd9363338fab7fb8c.mp4?t=1758614631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your shooter, each with a unique set of starting abilities, and pay attention to Clips in the Shop that grant even more abilities to your bullets; which yes, also have abilities. It's just ability on top of ability here. Create a build and bolster your power with Relics, which yes, also have abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LOCATIONS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123120/extras/1a7216c70ebde7709733714715087cc7.poster.avif?t=1758614631\" width=600 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123120/extras/1a7216c70ebde7709733714715087cc7.webm?t=1758614631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123120/extras/1a7216c70ebde7709733714715087cc7.mp4?t=1758614631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a chapter, select your sidearm, grab an extra mission from the intergalactic bounty board if you're feeling brave enough, and fire your way to victory. Victory isn't easily earned however, so make sure you build and stack correctly to walk away with the cash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BULLET POINTS (GET IT???)</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accept extra missions if you think you can handle the pressure, big payoffs await the brave</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember to blow your bank at the Shop, re-roll if your needs aren't met!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep a keen eye on Facilities when they appear, they may just work in your favor</p></li></ul>","developers":["Doonutsaur"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123120/7e43737e8d7320e425ac45fd1f05b94f98cc80fa/header.jpg?t=1758614631","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a92025 Poncle Limited. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.st